-- KAN-464. Forum Coimbra holds exactly the operator's 127 listed units.
--
-- Generated by cloudflare/extraction/reconcile_mall_list.py from
-- mall_lists/forum_coimbra.txt (read from forum-coimbra.com 2026-11-13) and
-- mall_lists/forum_coimbra_types.tsv, under the NorteShopping rules
-- (decisions.md, 2026-11-11). The plan is in docs/kan-464/.
--
-- The site gives each card a data-floor 1-3, the index of its map tab;
-- the tabs are Piso 0, 1 and 2, so the floor is data-floor - 1. Three
-- placeholders ("Abre brevemente", "Nova loja em breve" x2) are not units.
--
-- Footprint way/37079296, buffer 65 m. Address evidence is "Forum Coimbra"
-- only: Decathlon and a Galp station share the centre's street number and
-- are neighbours.
--
-- 1. WITHDRAWN (27). Nothing is deleted.
--       7 on the centre's address pinned 100 m to 4.6 km away — five listed
--         units whose unit is served from inside (McDonald's x2, Hanami
--         Sushi, Pandora, LEGO), a Coimbra SC kiosk and a bare store row
--         named after the centre;
--      19 unlisted rows inside, among them an IKEA point at Loja 0.27,
--         Nike, Oysho, Douglas, Claire's, The Body Shop, two CTT rows and a
--         car wash.
--       1 twin — a second The North Face row on the centre's street number.
--    Kept as neighbours: Decathlon and a Galp station in the ring.
--
-- 2. HELD (76). The row answering each unit takes the list's type and floor.
--
-- 3. WRITTEN (51) into curated_poi: 44 at OSM's position, 7 at the
--    centroid 40.2118179, -8.4437183.
--
-- Idempotent.
